01:00:55,510 --> 01:01:02,030
Let us hear from my very good friend uh Roland Busch at Siemens.
让我们听听我的好朋友、西门子的罗兰·布施的发言。

656
01:01:02,080 --> 01:01:03,630
Hi, Lip-Bu.
你好，立武。

657
01:01:03,680 --> 01:01:10,590
As a customer of Intel, we all know that global semiconductor demand has hit a high record.
作为英特尔的客户，我们都知道全球半导体需求已创下历史新高。

658
01:01:10,640 --> 01:01:15,950
In 2023, Siemens and Intel already joined forces to meet it.
2023年，西门子和英特尔已经携手应对这一需求。

659
01:01:16,000 --> 01:01:20,640
And now, we are taking our collaboration to the next level.
现在，我们正将合作提升到新水平。

660
01:01:20,690 --> 01:01:32,350
We are expanding our partnership across the entire value chain from design to manufacturing to chip applications in Siemens products.
我们正在整个价值链上扩展合作，从设计到制造，再到西门子产品中的芯片应用。

661
01:01:32,400 --> 01:01:40,990
We improve design quality through EDA automation and software solutions built with a genetic AI.
我们通过基于遗传AI的EDA自动化和软件解决方案提升设计质量。

662
01:01:41,040 --> 01:01:52,350
We partner on all areas of the manufacturing process including product lifecycle management automation electrification quality and sustainability.
我们在制造流程的所有领域开展合作，包括产品生命周期管理自动化、电气化、质量与可持续性。

663
01:01:52,400 --> 01:02:03,190
And what makes this even more relevant for us the chips created in this value chain will be used in our own Siemens products.
而对我们而言，这一点更加重要的是，这条价值链中制造的芯片将用于西门子自身的产品。

664
01:02:03,240 --> 01:02:07,230
Looking forward to what's coming up.
期待接下来的进展。

665
01:02:07,280 --> 01:02:13,590
Thank you, Roland.
谢谢，罗兰。

666
01:02:13,640 --> 01:02:20,070
We are delighted to expand our long partnership with the Siemens groups.
我们很高兴能拓展与西门子集团的长期合作关系。

667
01:02:20,120 --> 01:02:27,270
I'm looking forward to disclose more about this partnership in the coming months.
我期待在接下来的几个月里披露更多关于这一合作的信息。

668
01:02:27,320 --> 01:02:37,110
And we are working with several other partners to keep pushing the boundary of what is possible.
我们还与其他多家合作伙伴携手，持续推动可能的边界。

669
01:02:37,160 --> 01:02:43,310
I would like to close by returning to where we start our conversation.
我想以回到我们对话的起点来结束本次发言。

670
01:02:43,360 --> 01:02:48,830
The opportunity for Intel and for our partners is immense.
对英特尔以及我们的合作伙伴而言，机遇是巨大的。

671
01:02:48,880 --> 01:02:58,430
PC edge a genetic physical AI data center and emerging intelligence center.
个人电脑边缘、遗传物理AI、数据中心以及新兴智能中心。

672
01:02:58,480 --> 01:03:06,590
From silicon to SOC to system and applications.
从硅到系统级芯片，再到系统和应用。

673
01:03:06,640 --> 01:03:11,710
This opportunity is only made possible by all of you.
这个机会只有依靠在座各位才能实现。

674
01:03:11,760 --> 01:03:13,190
Look at the list.
看看这份名单。

675
01:03:13,240 --> 01:03:22,870
And the largest ecosystem of partners, suppliers, and customer.
以及最大的合作伙伴、供应商和客户生态系统。

676
01:03:22,920 --> 01:03:25,830
Intel is an iconic company.
英特尔是一家标志性公司。

677
01:03:25,880 --> 01:03:30,110
We laid the foundation of modern-day computing.
我们奠定了现代计算的基础。

678
01:03:30,160 --> 01:03:33,590
And we are proud of our heritage.
我们为自己的传承感到自豪。

679
01:03:33,640 --> 01:03:38,990
But we do not want to rest on our honors and gloria.
但我们不想躺在过去的荣誉和辉煌上。

680
01:03:39,040 --> 01:03:43,430
A year ago, I joined as a CEO.
一年前，我加入公司担任首席执行官。

681
01:03:43,480 --> 01:03:49,750
I challenged my team to work with me to build a new Intel.
我向我的团队发出挑战，要与我一起打造全新的英特尔。

682
01:03:49,800 --> 01:03:52,350
That is exactly what we are doing.
这正是我们正在做的事。

683
01:03:52,400 --> 01:03:55,150
We are not encumbered by the past.
我们不受过去束缚。

684
01:03:55,200 --> 01:04:00,150
We are building something wonderful.
我们正在创造一些了不起的东西。

685
01:04:00,200 --> 01:04:04,830
It has been year of transformation for Intel.
英特尔已经历了一年变革。

686
01:04:04,880 --> 01:04:10,510
We ramp our 18A to high volume with multiple products.
我们通过多款产品，将18A产能快速提升至高产量。

687
01:04:10,560 --> 01:04:15,910
We are executing well on our advanced packaging milestones.
我们在先进封装里程碑上执行得非常顺利。

688
01:04:15,960 --> 01:04:22,510
We make tremendous progress on engaging customers and building our foundry business.
我们在接触客户和建设代工业务方面取得了巨大进展。

689
01:04:22,560 --> 01:04:27,875
We introduced new SOCs for all major compute
我们推出了面向所有主要计算场景的新款系统级芯片。

690
01:04:27,925 --> 01:04:36,870
platforms from premium mobile to high-density cloud and 5G.
从高端移动平台到高密度云和5G平台。

691
01:04:36,920 --> 01:04:43,150
We are rebuilding and strengthening partnership across the ecosystem.
我们正在重建并加强整个生态系统中的合作。

692
01:04:43,200 --> 01:04:54,310
We are double down on creating new business opportunity across existing and emerging domains.
我们正加倍投入，在现有和新兴领域创造新的商业机遇。

693
01:04:54,360 --> 01:05:04,990
We are working at the forefront to imagine reimagine computing and make it highly efficient for the AI era.
我们正站在最前沿，重新构想计算方式，使其在人工智能时代更加高效。

694
01:05:05,040 --> 01:05:07,510
And this is just the beginning.
这还只是开始而已。

695
01:05:07,560 --> 01:05:15,710
I'm super excited to continue executing at hyper speed.
我非常兴奋，能够以超高速持续推进。

696
01:05:15,760 --> 01:05:23,830
Before the lights go out, the race begins.
灯灭之前，竞赛已然开始。

697
01:05:23,880 --> 01:05:33,350
From simulation to strategy, performance begins with compute, with electrons that power pace, and data that backs decisions.
从仿真到策略，性能始于计算，始于驱动速度的电子，以及支撑决策的数据。

698
01:05:33,400 --> 01:05:34,793
The race never ends.
竞争永无止境。

699
01:05:34,843 --> 01:05:37,550
Engineering never stops.
工程创新永不停歇。

700
01:05:37,600 --> 01:05:43,240
Intel, official compute partner of McLaren Racing.
英特尔，迈凯伦赛车官方计算合作伙伴。
